            end

        end
    end

    Internet --> Traefik
    Devices --> WireGuard

    Traefik --> Dashboard
    WireGuard --> Platform
    WireGuard --> Dashboard

    Gitea -->|Desired State| ArgoCD
    ArgoCD -->|Deploy| Apps

    Robots -->|Events| NATS
    Robots -->|Persistent Data| PostgreSQL
    Dashboard -->|Read / Write| PostgreSQL
    Dashboard -->|Events| NATS
